{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 43,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 850.04,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.641,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that the sons of Alma did go forth among the people, to declare the word unto them.",
      "verse": "43:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 6.821,
      "end": 9.422,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Alma, also, himself, could not rest,",
      "verse": "43:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 9.602,
      "end": 11.042,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he also went forth.",
      "verse": "43:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 11.722,
      "end": 14.648,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now we shall say no more concerning their preaching,",
      "verse": "43:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 14.828,
      "end": 22.351,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except that they preached the word, and the truth, according to the spirit of prophecy and revelation;",
      "verse": "43:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 22.531,
      "end": 26.525,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they preached after the holy order of God by which they were called.",
      "verse": "43:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 27.205,
      "end": 35.007,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I return to an account of the wars between the Nephites and the Lamanites, in the eighteenth year of the reign of the judges.",
      "verse": "43:3",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 35.687,
      "end": 40.006,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, it came to pass that the Zoramites became Lamanites;",
      "verse": "43:4",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 40.186,
      "end": 43.39,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, in the commencement of the eighteenth year",
      "verse": "43:4",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 43.57,
      "end": 47.842,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the people of the Nephites saw that the Lamanites were coming upon them;",
      "verse": "43:4",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 48.022,
      "end": 50.437,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they made preparations for war;",
      "verse": "43:4",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 50.617,
      "end": 54.286,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, they gathered together their armies in the land of Jershon.",
      "verse": "43:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 54.966,
      "end": 59.006,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the Lamanites came with their thousands;",
      "verse": "43:5",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 59.186,
      "end": 61.74,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they came into the land of Antionum,",
      "verse": "43:5",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 61.92,
      "end": 64.381,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which is the land of the Zoramites;",
      "verse": "43:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 64.561,
      "end": 67.487,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and a man by the name of Zerahemnah was their leader.",
      "verse": "43:5",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 68.167,
      "end": 73.183,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, as the Amalekites were of a more wicked and murderous disposition",
      "verse": "43:6",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 73.363,
      "end": 76.289,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "than the Lamanites were, in and of themselves,",
      "verse": "43:6",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 76.469,
      "end": 81.02,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, Zerahemnah appointed chief captains over the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "43:6",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 81.2,
      "end": 84.079,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were all Amalekites and Zoramites.",
      "verse": "43:6",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 84.759,
      "end": 86.152,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now this he did",
      "verse": "43:7",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 86.332,
      "end": 89.815,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might preserve their hatred towards the Nephites,",
      "verse": "43:7",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 89.995,
      "end": 92.642,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might bring them into subjection",
      "verse": "43:7",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 92.822,
      "end": 95.423,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to the accomplishment of his designs.",
      "verse": "43:7",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 96.103,
      "end": 101.908,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, his designs were to stir up the Lamanites to anger against the Nephites;",
      "verse": "43:8",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 102.088,
      "end": 103.203,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "this he did",
      "verse": "43:8",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 103.383,
      "end": 106.355,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might usurp great power over them,",
      "verse": "43:8",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 106.535,
      "end": 111.318,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also that he might gain power over the Nephites by bringing them into bondage.",
      "verse": "43:8",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 111.998,
      "end": 114.645,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now the design of the Nephites was",
      "verse": "43:9",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 114.825,
      "end": 117.379,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to support their lands, and their houses,",
      "verse": "43:9",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 117.559,
      "end": 119.881,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their wives, and their children,",
      "verse": "43:9",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 120.061,
      "end": 124.751,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might preserve them from the hands of their enemies;",
      "verse": "43:9",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 124.931,
      "end": 130.039,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also that they might preserve their rights and their privileges,",
      "verse": "43:9",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 130.219,
      "end": 132.541,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and also their liberty,",
      "verse": "43:9",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 132.721,
      "end": 136.158,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might worship God according to their desires.",
      "verse": "43:9",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 136.838,
      "end": 146.637,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For they knew that if they should fall into the hands of the Lamanites, that whosoever should worship God in spirit and in truth,",
      "verse": "43:10",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 146.817,
      "end": 150.393,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the true and the living God, the Lamanites would destroy.",
      "verse": "43:10",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 151.073,
      "end": 156.321,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and they also knew the extreme hatred of the Lamanites towards their brethren,",
      "verse": "43:11",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 156.501,
      "end": 159.102,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who were the people of Anti-Nephi-Lehi,",
      "verse": "43:11",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 159.282,
      "end": 161.743,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who were called the people of Ammon\u2014",
      "verse": "43:11",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 161.923,
      "end": 163.873,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they would not take up arms,",
      "verse": "43:11",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 164.053,
      "end": 165.678,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, they had entered",
      "verse": "43:11",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 165.858,
      "end": 168.552,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "into a covenant and they would not break it\u2014",
      "verse": "43:11",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 168.732,
      "end": 172.679,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, if they should fall into the hands of the Lamanites",
      "verse": "43:11",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 172.859,
      "end": 174.438,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they would be destroyed.",
      "verse": "43:11",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 175.118,
      "end": 178.926,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Nephites would not suffer that they should be destroyed;",
      "verse": "43:12",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 179.106,
      "end": 182.032,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they gave them lands for their inheritance.",
      "verse": "43:12",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 182.712,
      "end": 189.26,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the people of Ammon did give unto the Nephites a large portion of their substance to support their armies;",
      "verse": "43:13",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 189.44,
      "end": 199.843,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus the Nephites were compelled, alone, to withstand against the Lamanites, who were a compound of Laman and Lemuel, and the sons of Ishmael,",
      "verse": "43:13",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 200.023,
      "end": 202.949,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all those who had dissented from the Nephites,",
      "verse": "43:13",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 203.129,
      "end": 205.497,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who were Amalekites and Zoramites,",
      "verse": "43:13",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 205.677,
      "end": 208.51,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the descendants of the priests of Noah.",
      "verse": "43:13",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 209.19,
      "end": 214.113,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now those descendants were as numerous, nearly, as were the Nephites;",
      "verse": "43:14",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 214.293,
      "end": 220.702,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus the Nephites were obliged to contend with their brethren, even unto bloodshed.",
      "verse": "43:14",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 221.382,
      "end": 224.819,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass as the armies of the Lamanites",
      "verse": "43:15",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 224.999,
      "end": 227.832,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "had gathered together in the land of Antionum,",
      "verse": "43:15",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 228.012,
      "end": 232.656,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, the armies of the Nephites were prepared to meet them in the land of Jershon.",
      "verse": "43:15",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 233.336,
      "end": 235.565,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, the leader of the Nephites,",
      "verse": "43:16",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 235.745,
      "end": 238.439,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or the man who had been appointed",
      "verse": "43:16",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 238.619,
      "end": 241.22,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to be the chief captain over the Nephites\u2014",
      "verse": "43:16",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 241.4,
      "end": 246.276,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "now the chief captain took the command of all the armies of the Nephites\u2014",
      "verse": "43:16",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 246.456,
      "end": 248.174,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his name was Moroni;",
      "verse": "43:16",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 248.854,
      "end": 250.944,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Moroni took all the command,",
      "verse": "43:17",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 251.124,
      "end": 253.632,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the government of their wars.",
      "verse": "43:17",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 253.812,
      "end": 256.366,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he was only twenty and five years old",
      "verse": "43:17",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 256.546,
      "end": 260.865,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when he was appointed chief captain over the armies of the Nephites.",
      "verse": "43:17",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 261.545,
      "end": 266.096,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he met the Lamanites in the borders of Jershon,",
      "verse": "43:18",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 266.276,
      "end": 271.802,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his people were armed with swords, and with cimeters, and all manner of weapons of war.",
      "verse": "43:18",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 272.482,
      "end": 277.033,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And when the armies of the Lamanites saw that the people of Nephi,",
      "verse": "43:19",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 277.213,
      "end": 283.807,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or that Moroni, had prepared his people with breastplates and with arm-shields, yea, and also shields to defend their heads,",
      "verse": "43:19",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 283.987,
      "end": 286.773,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also they were dressed with thick clothing\u2014",
      "verse": "43:19",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 287.453,
      "end": 291.168,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the army of Zerahemnah was not prepared with any such thing;",
      "verse": "43:20",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 291.348,
      "end": 296.271,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they had only their swords and their cimeters, their bows and their arrows,",
      "verse": "43:20",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 296.451,
      "end": 298.634,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "their stones and their slings;",
      "verse": "43:20",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 298.814,
      "end": 304.062,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were naked, save it were a skin which was girded about their loins;",
      "verse": "43:20",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 304.242,
      "end": 305.867,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, all were naked,",
      "verse": "43:20",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 306.047,
      "end": 309.391,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it were the Zoramites and the Amalekites;",
      "verse": "43:20",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 310.071,
      "end": 313.09,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But they were not armed with breastplates, nor shields\u2014",
      "verse": "43:21",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 313.27,
      "end": 319.354,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, they were exceedingly afraid of the armies of the Nephites because of their armor,",
      "verse": "43:21",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 319.534,
      "end": 323.389,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "notwithstanding their number being so much greater than the Nephites.",
      "verse": "43:21",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 324.069,
      "end": 331.081,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, now it came to pass that they durst not come against the Nephites in the borders of Jershon;",
      "verse": "43:22",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 331.261,
      "end": 336.044,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they departed out of the land of Antionum into the wilderness,",
      "verse": "43:22",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 336.224,
      "end": 339.568,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and took their journey round about in the wilderness,",
      "verse": "43:22",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 339.748,
      "end": 342.07,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "away by the head of the river Sidon,",
      "verse": "43:22",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 342.25,
      "end": 345.222,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might come into the land of Manti",
      "verse": "43:22",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 345.402,
      "end": 347.445,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and take possession of the land;",
      "verse": "43:22",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 347.625,
      "end": 352.362,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they did not suppose that the armies of Moroni would know whither they had gone.",
      "verse": "43:22",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 353.042,
      "end": 358.29,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But it came to pass, as soon as they had departed into the wilderness",
      "verse": "43:23",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 358.47,
      "end": 362.139,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Moroni sent spies into the wilderness to watch their camp;",
      "verse": "43:23",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 362.319,
      "end": 372.118,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and Moroni, also, knowing of the prophecies of Alma, sent certain men unto him, desiring him that he should inquire of the Lord",
      "verse": "43:23",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 372.298,
      "end": 377.267,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whither the armies of the Nephites should go to defend themselves against the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "43:23",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 377.947,
      "end": 382.034,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the word of the Lord came unto Alma,",
      "verse": "43:24",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 382.214,
      "end": 385.0,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and Alma informed the messengers of Moroni,",
      "verse": "43:24",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 385.18,
      "end": 389.824,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the armies of the Lamanites were marching round about in the wilderness,",
      "verse": "43:24",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 390.004,
      "end": 393.162,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might come over into the land of Manti,",
      "verse": "43:24",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 393.342,
      "end": 398.311,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might commence an attack upon the weaker part of the people.",
      "verse": "43:24",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 398.491,
      "end": 402.253,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And those messengers went and delivered the message unto Moroni.",
      "verse": "43:24",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 402.933,
      "end": 406.973,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now Moroni, leaving a part of his army in the land of Jershon,",
      "verse": "43:25",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 407.153,
      "end": 411.751,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "lest by any means a part of the Lamanites should come into that land",
      "verse": "43:25",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 411.931,
      "end": 413.928,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and take possession of the city,",
      "verse": "43:25",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 414.108,
      "end": 416.709,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "took the remaining part of his army",
      "verse": "43:25",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 416.889,
      "end": 419.49,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and marched over into the land of Manti.",
      "verse": "43:25",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 420.17,
      "end": 424.117,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he caused that all the people in that quarter of the land",
      "verse": "43:26",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 424.297,
      "end": 433.724,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "should gather themselves together to battle against the Lamanites, to defend their lands and their country, their rights and their liberties;",
      "verse": "43:26",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 433.904,
      "end": 438.687,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they were prepared against the time of the coming of the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "43:26",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 439.367,
      "end": 444.708,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Moroni caused that his army should be secreted in the valley",
      "verse": "43:27",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 444.888,
      "end": 447.674,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was near the bank of the river Sidon,",
      "verse": "43:27",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 447.854,
      "end": 451.337,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was on the west of the river Sidon in the wilderness.",
      "verse": "43:27",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 452.017,
      "end": 454.571,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Moroni placed spies round about,",
      "verse": "43:28",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 454.751,
      "end": 458.931,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might know when the camp of the Lamanites should come.",
      "verse": "43:28",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 459.611,
      "end": 463.233,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, as Moroni knew the intention of the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "43:29",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 463.413,
      "end": 466.664,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that it was their intention to destroy their brethren,",
      "verse": "43:29",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 466.844,
      "end": 469.909,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or to subject them and bring them into bondage",
      "verse": "43:29",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 470.089,
      "end": 474.919,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might establish a kingdom unto themselves over all the land;",
      "verse": "43:29",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 475.599,
      "end": 484.237,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he also knowing that it was the only desire of the Nephites to preserve their lands, and their liberty, and their church,",
      "verse": "43:30",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 484.417,
      "end": 488.922,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he thought it no sin that he should defend them by stratagem;",
      "verse": "43:30",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 489.102,
      "end": 493.885,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, he found by his spies which course the Lamanites were to take.",
      "verse": "43:30",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 494.565,
      "end": 496.98,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, he divided his army",
      "verse": "43:31",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 497.16,
      "end": 499.946,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and brought a part over into the valley,",
      "verse": "43:31",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 500.126,
      "end": 502.355,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and concealed them on the east,",
      "verse": "43:31",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 502.535,
      "end": 504.718,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and on the south of the hill Riplah;",
      "verse": "43:31",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 505.398,
      "end": 510.367,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the remainder he concealed in the west valley, on the west of the river Sidon,",
      "verse": "43:32",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 510.547,
      "end": 513.333,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and so down into the borders of the land Manti.",
      "verse": "43:32",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 514.013,
      "end": 517.357,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus having placed his army according to his desire,",
      "verse": "43:33",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 517.537,
      "end": 519.302,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he was prepared to meet them.",
      "verse": "43:33",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 519.982,
      "end": 524.58,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the Lamanites came up on the north of the hill,",
      "verse": "43:34",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 524.76,
      "end": 527.732,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "where a part of the army of Moroni was concealed.",
      "verse": "43:34",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 528.412,
      "end": 531.152,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And as the Lamanites had passed the hill Riplah,",
      "verse": "43:35",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 531.332,
      "end": 532.957,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and came into the valley,",
      "verse": "43:35",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 533.137,
      "end": 535.645,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to cross the river Sidon,",
      "verse": "43:35",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 535.825,
      "end": 538.983,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the army which was concealed on the south of the hill,",
      "verse": "43:35",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 539.163,
      "end": 542.042,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was led by a man whose name was Lehi,",
      "verse": "43:35",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 542.222,
      "end": 544.08,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he led his army forth",
      "verse": "43:35",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 544.26,
      "end": 547.975,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and encircled the Lamanites about on the east in their rear.",
      "verse": "43:35",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 548.655,
      "end": 551.349,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "43:36",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 551.529,
      "end": 555.151,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when they saw the Nephites coming upon them in their rear,",
      "verse": "43:36",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 555.331,
      "end": 559.278,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "turned them about and began to contend with the army of Lehi.",
      "verse": "43:36",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 559.958,
      "end": 562.791,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the work of death commenced on both sides,",
      "verse": "43:37",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 562.971,
      "end": 566.268,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but it was more dreadful on the part of the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "43:37",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 566.448,
      "end": 573.832,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for their nakedness was exposed to the heavy blows of the Nephites with their swords and their cimeters,",
      "verse": "43:37",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 574.012,
      "end": 576.938,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which brought death almost at every stroke.",
      "verse": "43:37",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 577.618,
      "end": 579.197,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "While on the other hand,",
      "verse": "43:38",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 579.377,
      "end": 586.529,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there was now and then a man fell among the Nephites, by their swords and the loss of blood,",
      "verse": "43:38",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 586.709,
      "end": 590.378,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they being shielded from the more vital parts of the body,",
      "verse": "43:38",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 590.558,
      "end": 596.084,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or the more vital parts of the body being shielded from the strokes of the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "43:38",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 596.264,
      "end": 600.722,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "by their breastplates, and their armshields, and their head-plates;",
      "verse": "43:38",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 600.902,
      "end": 606.15,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus the Nephites did carry on the work of death among the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "43:38",
      "lineIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "start": 606.83,
      "end": 613.75,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the Lamanites became frightened, because of the great destruction among them,",
      "verse": "43:39",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 613.93,
      "end": 617.367,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even until they began to flee towards the river Sidon.",
      "verse": "43:39",
      "lineIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "start": 618.047,
      "end": 620.88,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they were pursued by Lehi and his men;",
      "verse": "43:40",
      "lineIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "start": 621.06,
      "end": 624.497,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were driven by Lehi into the waters of Sidon,",
      "verse": "43:40",
      "lineIndex": 155
    },
    {
      "start": 624.677,
      "end": 627.185,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they crossed the waters of Sidon.",
      "verse": "43:40",
      "lineIndex": 156
    },
    {
      "start": 627.365,
      "end": 631.637,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Lehi retained his armies upon the bank of the river Sidon",
      "verse": "43:40",
      "lineIndex": 157
    },
    {
      "start": 631.817,
      "end": 633.535,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they should not cross.",
      "verse": "43:40",
      "lineIndex": 158
    },
    {
      "start": 634.215,
      "end": 640.949,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Moroni and his army met the Lamanites in the valley, on the other side of the river Sidon,",
      "verse": "43:41",
      "lineIndex": 159
    },
    {
      "start": 641.129,
      "end": 644.101,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to fall upon them and to slay them.",
      "verse": "43:41",
      "lineIndex": 160
    },
    {
      "start": 644.781,
      "end": 650.447,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Lamanites did flee again before them, towards the land of Manti;",
      "verse": "43:42",
      "lineIndex": 161
    },
    {
      "start": 650.627,
      "end": 653.785,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were met again by the armies of Moroni.",
      "verse": "43:42",
      "lineIndex": 162
    },
    {
      "start": 654.465,
      "end": 657.669,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now in this case the Lamanites did fight exceedingly;",
      "verse": "43:43",
      "lineIndex": 163
    },
    {
      "start": 657.849,
      "end": 663.793,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, never had the Lamanites been known to fight with such exceedingly great strength and courage,",
      "verse": "43:43",
      "lineIndex": 164
    },
    {
      "start": 663.973,
      "end": 665.831,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "no, not even from the beginning.",
      "verse": "43:43",
      "lineIndex": 165
    },
    {
      "start": 666.511,
      "end": 673.477,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they were inspired by the Zoramites and the Amalekites, who were their chief captains and leaders,",
      "verse": "43:44",
      "lineIndex": 166
    },
    {
      "start": 673.657,
      "end": 675.236,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and by Zerahemnah,",
      "verse": "43:44",
      "lineIndex": 167
    },
    {
      "start": 675.416,
      "end": 680.06,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who was their chief captain, or their chief leader and commander;",
      "verse": "43:44",
      "lineIndex": 168
    },
    {
      "start": 680.24,
      "end": 682.376,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, they did fight like dragons,",
      "verse": "43:44",
      "lineIndex": 169
    },
    {
      "start": 682.556,
      "end": 685.76,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and many of the Nephites were slain by their hands,",
      "verse": "43:44",
      "lineIndex": 170
    },
    {
      "start": 685.94,
      "end": 689.377,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, for they did smite in two many of their head-plates,",
      "verse": "43:44",
      "lineIndex": 171
    },
    {
      "start": 689.557,
      "end": 692.715,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did pierce many of their breastplates,",
      "verse": "43:44",
      "lineIndex": 172
    },
    {
      "start": 692.895,
      "end": 695.496,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did smite off many of their arms;",
      "verse": "43:44",
      "lineIndex": 173
    },
    {
      "start": 695.676,
      "end": 699.252,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus the Lamanites did smite in their fierce anger.",
      "verse": "43:44",
      "lineIndex": 174
    },
    {
      "start": 699.932,
      "end": 703.508,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, the Nephites were inspired by a better cause,",
      "verse": "43:45",
      "lineIndex": 175
    },
    {
      "start": 703.688,
      "end": 706.846,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they were not fighting for monarchy nor power",
      "verse": "43:45",
      "lineIndex": 176
    },
    {
      "start": 707.026,
      "end": 710.184,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but they were fighting for their homes and their liberties,",
      "verse": "43:45",
      "lineIndex": 177
    },
    {
      "start": 710.364,
      "end": 713.615,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "their wives and their children, and their all,",
      "verse": "43:45",
      "lineIndex": 178
    },
    {
      "start": 713.795,
      "end": 716.814,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, for their rites of worship and their church.",
      "verse": "43:45",
      "lineIndex": 179
    },
    {
      "start": 717.494,
      "end": 719.862,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they were doing that which they felt",
      "verse": "43:46",
      "lineIndex": 180
    },
    {
      "start": 720.042,
      "end": 722.968,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "was the duty which they owed to their God;",
      "verse": "43:46",
      "lineIndex": 181
    },
    {
      "start": 723.148,
      "end": 727.049,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the Lord had said unto them, and also unto their fathers,",
      "verse": "43:46",
      "lineIndex": 182
    },
    {
      "start": 727.229,
      "end": 731.362,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that: Inasmuch as ye are not guilty of the first offense,",
      "verse": "43:46",
      "lineIndex": 183
    },
    {
      "start": 731.542,
      "end": 733.028,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither the second,",
      "verse": "43:46",
      "lineIndex": 184
    },
    {
      "start": 733.208,
      "end": 737.898,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall not suffer yourselves to be slain by the hands of your enemies.",
      "verse": "43:46",
      "lineIndex": 185
    },
    {
      "start": 738.578,
      "end": 740.668,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again, the Lord has said",
      "verse": "43:47",
      "lineIndex": 186
    },
    {
      "start": 740.848,
      "end": 744.424,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that: Ye shall defend your families even unto bloodshed.",
      "verse": "43:47",
      "lineIndex": 187
    },
    {
      "start": 744.604,
      "end": 757.793,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore for this cause were the Nephites contending with the Lamanites, to defend themselves, and their families, and their lands, their country, and their rights, and their religion.",
      "verse": "43:47",
      "lineIndex": 188
    },
    {
      "start": 758.473,
      "end": 764.51,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when the men of Moroni saw the fierceness and the anger of the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "43:48",
      "lineIndex": 189
    },
    {
      "start": 764.69,
      "end": 767.662,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were about to shrink and flee from them.",
      "verse": "43:48",
      "lineIndex": 190
    },
    {
      "start": 767.842,
      "end": 773.508,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Moroni, perceiving their intent, sent forth and inspired their hearts with these thoughts\u2014",
      "verse": "43:48",
      "lineIndex": 191
    },
    {
      "start": 773.688,
      "end": 776.66,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, the thoughts of their lands, their liberty,",
      "verse": "43:48",
      "lineIndex": 192
    },
    {
      "start": 776.84,
      "end": 779.069,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, their freedom from bondage.",
      "verse": "43:48",
      "lineIndex": 193
    },
    {
      "start": 779.749,
      "end": 783.046,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they turned upon the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "43:49",
      "lineIndex": 194
    },
    {
      "start": 783.226,
      "end": 788.892,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they cried with one voice unto the Lord their God, for their liberty and their freedom from bondage.",
      "verse": "43:49",
      "lineIndex": 195
    },
    {
      "start": 789.572,
      "end": 792.823,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they began to stand against the Lamanites with power;",
      "verse": "43:50",
      "lineIndex": 196
    },
    {
      "start": 793.003,
      "end": 797.275,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in that selfsame hour that they cried unto the Lord for their freedom,",
      "verse": "43:50",
      "lineIndex": 197
    },
    {
      "start": 797.455,
      "end": 799.963,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Lamanites began to flee before them;",
      "verse": "43:50",
      "lineIndex": 198
    },
    {
      "start": 800.143,
      "end": 802.744,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they fled even to the waters of Sidon.",
      "verse": "43:50",
      "lineIndex": 199
    },
    {
      "start": 803.424,
      "end": 805.792,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, the Lamanites were more numerous,",
      "verse": "43:51",
      "lineIndex": 200
    },
    {
      "start": 805.972,
      "end": 809.409,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, by more than double the number of the Nephites;",
      "verse": "43:51",
      "lineIndex": 201
    },
    {
      "start": 809.589,
      "end": 811.911,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, they were driven",
      "verse": "43:51",
      "lineIndex": 202
    },
    {
      "start": 812.091,
      "end": 818.593,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that they were gathered together in one body in the valley, upon the bank by the river Sidon.",
      "verse": "43:51",
      "lineIndex": 203
    },
    {
      "start": 819.273,
      "end": 822.524,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore the armies of Moroni encircled them about,",
      "verse": "43:52",
      "lineIndex": 204
    },
    {
      "start": 822.704,
      "end": 825.165,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even on both sides of the river,",
      "verse": "43:52",
      "lineIndex": 205
    },
    {
      "start": 825.345,
      "end": 828.271,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, on the east were the men of Lehi.",
      "verse": "43:52",
      "lineIndex": 206
    },
    {
      "start": 828.951,
      "end": 833.688,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore when Zerahemnah saw the men of Lehi on the east of the river Sidon,",
      "verse": "43:53",
      "lineIndex": 207
    },
    {
      "start": 833.868,
      "end": 838.001,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the armies of Moroni on the west of the river Sidon,",
      "verse": "43:53",
      "lineIndex": 208
    },
    {
      "start": 838.181,
      "end": 842.918,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they were encircled about by the Nephites, they were struck with terror.",
      "verse": "43:53",
      "lineIndex": 209
    },
    {
      "start": 843.598,
      "end": 845.874,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now Moroni, when he saw their terror,",
      "verse": "43:54",
      "lineIndex": 210
    },
    {
